					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 3: GETTING CREATIVE\n\nIn this example we're using the Text Render to create some funky patterns.\nWe take a 3 character long string from the user.\nIn case the user inputs a string longer than 3, we cut off the end using Substring.\nNext, we use the beats from Transport Time to cycle our start position.\n\nThe Substring node is set to wrapping so no matter how large the start value becomes, it will get wrapped around in input length."
					}
				},
